<section class="saas-legal-page">
  <div class="saas-container saas-page-shell">
    <div class="saas-page-hero">
      <p class="saas-legal-kicker">Sticker Ideas</p>
      <h1>Cute Sticker Ideas for AI Stickers</h1>
      <p>
        Use these cute sticker ideas as prompt starters for animals, food, cozy objects, tiny
        mascots, expressive characters, and playful everyday items.
      </p>
      <.link class="saas-button saas-button-primary" navigate={~p"/search"}>Search Sticker Ideas</.link>
    </div>

    <div class="saas-info-grid">
      <article class="saas-info-panel">
        <h2>Cute animal stickers</h2>
        <p>
          Try prompts like sleepy kitten with moon pillow, happy corgi in rain boots, or tiny panda
          holding a cookie.
        </p>
      </article>
      <article class="saas-info-panel">
        <h2>Food and object stickers</h2>
        <p>
          Turn simple objects into characters: smiling coffee cup, cozy soup bowl, cheerful flower,
          or strawberry with tiny sunglasses.
        </p>
      </article>
      <article class="saas-info-panel">
        <h2>Mascot sticker prompts</h2>
        <p>
          For brands or projects, describe a friendly mascot, its emotion, colors, and use case,
          then regenerate variations from the best result.
        </p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
